WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,520
Before the Dilong Net is ready, we will definitely focus on fishing.

2
00:00:03,520 --> 00:00:06,600
However, in addition to the hand net, you can also bring a push net.

3
00:00:06,600 --> 00:00:09,240
The push net is only suitable for manual propulsion during diving.

4
00:00:09,240 --> 00:00:13,430
It is most suitable to use it to catch shrimps, crabs and scallops

5
00:00:13,430 --> 00:00:15,630
Now is the season for prawns

6
00:00:15,630 --> 00:00:18,030
What I remember about these days in my previous life

7
00:00:18,030 --> 00:00:20,430
I once heard something at the poker table

8
00:00:20,430 --> 00:00:22,900
Said he was a fisherman from the next town

9
00:00:22,900 --> 00:00:25,900
A large number of shrimps were caught in a place in Jinghai

10
00:00:25,900 --> 00:00:28,690
That batch of shrimps sold for a high price of five yuan

11
00:00:28,890 --> 00:00:30,090
Rely on this sum

12
00:00:30,090 --> 00:00:33,290
The fisherman's house was built with three large, brand-new tile-roofed houses.

13
00:00:33,290 --> 00:00:35,890
This incident caused a sensation in several nearby fishing villages.

14
00:00:35,890 --> 00:00:37,490
While everyone was talking about chess,

15
00:00:37,490 --> 00:00:40,890
Several people invited the fisherman to drink and tricked him into setting the net.

16
00:00:40,890 --> 00:00:44,310
It's a pity that we have to wait until the next day when everyone swarms over

17
00:00:44,310 --> 00:00:46,310
Because there are too many people and boats going there

18
00:00:46,310 --> 00:00:49,110
Each boat only caught a dozen kilograms of prawns.

19
00:00:49,110 --> 00:00:51,710
The story of the fisherman has not yet been circulated.

20
00:00:51,710 --> 00:00:54,310
This also means that the other party has not caught the prawns yet.

21
00:00:54,310 --> 00:00:56,910
Although I don’t know when the prawns will appear.

22
00:00:57,110 --> 00:00:58,710
But as long as I seize the opportunity

23
00:00:58,710 --> 00:01:00,110
Where do you stay every day?

24
00:01:00,110 --> 00:01:01,310
Sooner or later you can catch it

25
00:01:01,310 --> 00:01:03,310
The prawns lie in the mud during the day

26
00:01:03,310 --> 00:01:05,910
Only at night will I go out and swim against the clock

27
00:01:05,910 --> 00:01:07,110
want to capture them

28
00:01:07,110 --> 00:01:10,310
You must choose the time between two o'clock in the morning and dawn
